                <button class="nav-link" id="fr-gateway-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#fr-gateway" type="button" role="tab"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="vertical-align:-2px"><path d="M8 0a8 8 0 1 0 0 16A8 8 0 0 0 8 0zM2.04 4.81A6.503 6.503 0 0 1 7 1.18v.7c0 .6-.4 1.1-.9 1.4l-.5.3c-.5.3-.6.9-.3 1.3l.3.4c.2.3.3.7.1 1.1l-.4.7c-.2.3-.5.5-.9.5h-.3c-.6 0-1.1.5-1.1 1.1v.7c0 .6-.5 1.1-1.1 1.1-.2 0-.3 0-.5-.1l-.5-.3a6.44 6.44 0 0 1-1.32-3.97zm7.85 8.55A6.48 6.48 0 0 1 8 14.82v-.9c0-.7.4-1.3.9-1.7l.2-.1c.5-.3.9-.9.7-1.5l-.3-.8c-.1-.3 0-.6.1-.8l1-1.2c.3-.3.7-.5 1.1-.5h.7c.4 0 .8-.1 1.1-.3l.1-.1c.5.9.8 2.1.6 3.3a6.51 6.51 0 0 1-3.8 3.68z"/></svg> Gateway</button>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                <button class="nav-link" id="fr-frameworks-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#fr-frameworks" type="button" role="tab"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="vertical-align:-2px"><path d="M8 4.754a3.246 3.246 0 1 0 0 6.492 3.246 3.246 0 0 0 0-6.492zM5.754 8a2.246 2.246 0 1 1 4.492 0 2.246 2.246 0 0 1-4.492 0z"/><path d="M9.796 1.343c-.527-1.79-3.065-1.79-3.592 0l-.094.319a.873.873 0 0 1-1.255.52l-.292-.16c-1.64-.892-3.433.902-2.54 2.541l.159.292a.873.873 0 0 1-.52 1.255l-.319.094c-1.79.527-1.79 3.065 0 3.592l.319.094a.873.873 0 0 1 .52 1.255l-.16.292c-.892 1.64.901 3.434 2.541 2.54l.292-.159a.873.873 0 0 1 1.255.52l.094.319c.527 1.79 3.065 1.79 3.592 0l.094-.319a.873.873 0 0 1 1.255-.52l.292.16c1.64.893 3.434-.902 2.54-2.541l-.159-.292a.873.873 0 0 1 .52-1.255l.319-.094c1.79-.527 1.79-3.065 0-3.592l-.319-.094a.873.873 0 0 1-.52-1.255l.16-.292c.893-1.64-.902-3.433-2.541-2.54l-.292.159a.873.873 0 0 1-1.255-.52l-.094-.319zm-2.633.283c.246-.835 1.428-.835 1.674 0l.094.319a1.873 1.873 0 0 0 2.693 1.115l.291-.16c.764-.415 1.6.42 1.184 1.185l-.159.292a1.873 1.873 0 0 0 1.116 2.692l.318.094c.835.246.835 1.428 0 1.674l-.319.094a1.873 1.873 0 0 0-1.115 2.693l.16.291c.415.764-.42 1.6-1.185 1.184l-.291-.159a1.873 1.873 0 0 0-2.693 1.116l-.094.318c-.246.835-1.428.835-1.674 0l-.094-.319a1.873 1.873 0 0 0-2.692-1.115l-.292.16c-.764.415-1.6-.42-1.184-1.185l.159-.291A1.873 1.873 0 0 0 1.945 8.93l-.319-.094c-.835-.246-.835-1.428 0-1.674l.319-.094A1.873 1.873 0 0 0 3.06 4.377l-.16-.292c-.415-.764.42-1.6 1.185-1.184l.292.159a1.873 1.873 0 0 0 2.692-1.115l.094-.319z"/></svg> Frameworks</button>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                <button class="nav-link" id="fr-errors-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#fr-errors" type="button" role="tab"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="vertical-align:-2px"><path d="M8.982 1.566a1.13 1.13 0 0 0-1.96 0L.165 13.233c-.457.778.091 1.767.98 1.767h13.713c.889 0 1.438-.99.98-1.767L8.982 1.566zM8 5c.535 0 .954.462.9.995l-.35 3.507a.552.552 0 0 1-1.1 0L7.1 5.995A.905.905 0 0 1 8 5zm.002 6a1 1 0 1 1 0 2 1 1 0 0 1 0-2z"/></svg> Erreurs</button>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                <button class="nav-link" id="fr-prod-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#fr-prod" type="button" role="tab"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="vertical-align:-2px"><path d="M5.338 1.59a61.44 61.44 0 0 0-2.837.856.481.481 0 0 0-.328.39c-.554 4.157.726 7.19 2.253 9.188a10.725 10.725 0 0 0 2.287 2.233c.346.244.652.42.893.533.12.057.218.095.293.118a.55.55 0 0 0 .101.025.615.615 0 0 0 .1-.025c.076-.023.174-.061.294-.118.24-.113.547-.29.893-.533a10.726 10.726 0 0 0 2.287-2.233c1.527-1.997 2.807-5.031 2.253-9.188a.48.48 0 0 0-.328-.39c-.651-.213-1.75-.56-2.837-.855C9.552 1.29 8.531 1.067 8 1c-.53.067-1.552.29-2.662.59z"/></svg> Production</button>
            </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="tab-content">
            @* ──── Tab 1: Enregistrement ──── *@
            <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="fr-register" role="tabpanel">

            @* ──── Carte : Health Monitoring ──── *@
            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header"><h5 class="mb-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="vertical-align:-2px"><path d="M8 16s6-5.686 6-10A6 6 0 0 0 2 6c0 4.314 6 10 6 10zm0-7a3 3 0 1 1 0-6 3 3 0 0 1 0 6z"/></svg> Health Monitoring</h5></div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Le Gateway vérifie périodiquement la santé de vos services externes (toutes les 30 secondes).</p>
                    <p>Si un service ne répond pas 3 fois de suite, son statut passe à <strong>Suspended</strong>.</p>
                    <p>Consultez l'état de santé depuis le tableau de bord : <code>/Developer/Services</code> — l'indicateur ✅ vert signifie service OK, ❌ rouge indique des échecs.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header"><h5 class="mb-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="vertical-align:-2px"><path d="M14 4.5V14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V2a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5.5L14 4.5zm-3 0A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 9.5 3V1H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v12a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h8a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V4.5h-2z"/><path d="M5 6.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h5a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5zm0 2a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h5a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5zm0 2a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h5a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5z"/></svg> Enregistrer un service externe</h5></div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Enregistrez votre API externe pour la rendre accessible via le Gateway.</p>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>POST /api/v1/external-services/register
Headers: X-API-Key: dn_votre_cle
Body: {
  "name": "Mon Service",
  "slug": "mon-service",
  "baseUrl": "https://api.monservice.com",
  "description": "...",
  "healthEndpoint": "/health"
}</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">cURL</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>curl -X POST http://localhost:5075/api/v1/external-services/register \
  -H "X-API-Key: dn_votre_cle" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "name": "Mon Service",
    "slug": "mon-service",
    "baseUrl": "https://api.monservice.com"
  }'</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">Python</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>import requests

url = "http://localhost:5075/api/v1/external-services/register"
headers = {"X-API-Key": "dn_votre_cle"}
data = {
    "name": "Mon Service",
    "slug": "mon-service",
    "baseUrl": "https://api.monservice.com"
}
response = requests.post(url, json=data, headers=headers)
print(response.json())</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">Node.js</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>const axios = require('axios');

const response = await axios.post(
  'http://localhost:5075/api/v1/external-services/register',
  {
    name: 'Mon Service',
    slug: 'mon-service',
    baseUrl: 'https://api.monservice.com'
  },
  {
    headers: { 'X-API-Key': 'dn_votre_cle' }
  }
);
console.log(response.data);</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">C#</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>using var client = new HttpClient();
client.DefaultRequestHeaders.Add("X-API-Key", "dn_votre_cle");

var payload = new {
    name = "Mon Service",
    slug = "mon-service",
    baseUrl = "https://api.monservice.com"
};

var response = await client.PostAsJsonAsync(
    "http://localhost:5075/api/v1/external-services/register", payload);
var result = await response.Content.ReadFromJsonAsync&lt;ExternalServiceResponse&gt;();</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">Java</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>OkHttpClient client = new OkHttpClient();

MediaType JSON = MediaType.parse("application/json; charset=utf-8");
String json = "{"
    + "\"name\":\"Mon Service\","
    + "\"slug\":\"mon-service\","
    + "\"baseUrl\":\"https://api.monservice.com\""
    + "}";

Request request = new Request.Builder()
    .url("http://localhost:5075/api/v1/external-services/register")
    .addHeader("X-API-Key", "dn_votre_cle")
    .post(RequestBody.create(json, JSON))
    .build();

Response response = client.newCall(request).execute();</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">Go</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>package main

import (
    "bytes"
    "encoding/json"
    "net/http"
)

func main() {
    payload := map[string]string{
        "name":    "Mon Service",
        "slug":    "mon-service",
        "baseUrl": "https://api.monservice.com",
    }
    body, _ := json.Marshal(payload)

    req, _ := http.NewRequest("POST",
        "http://localhost:5075/api/v1/external-services/register",
        bytes.NewBuffer(body))
    req.Header.Set("X-API-Key", "dn_votre_cle")
    req.Header.Set("Content-Type", "application/json")

    client := &http.Client{}
    resp, _ := client.Do(req)
    defer resp.Body.Close()
}</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">Rust</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>use reqwest;
use serde_json::json;

#[tokio::main]
async fn main() {
    let client = reqwest::Client::new();
    let response = client
        .post("http://localhost:5075/api/v1/external-services/register")
        .header("X-API-Key", "dn_votre_cle")
        .json(&json!({
            "name": "Mon Service",
            "slug": "mon-service",
            "baseUrl": "https://api.monservice.com"
        }))
        .send()
        .await
        .unwrap();
    println!("{:?}", response.text().await.unwrap());
}</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">PHP</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>$ch = curl_init("http://localhost:5075/api/v1/external-services/register");
curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_POST, true);
curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER, [
    "X-API-Key: dn_votre_cle",
    "Content-Type: application/json"
]);
curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS, json_encode([
    "name" => "Mon Service",
    "slug" => "mon-service",
    "baseUrl" => "https://api.monservice.com"
]));
curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER, true);
$response = curl_exec($ch);
curl_close($ch);</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">Ruby</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>require 'net/http'
require 'json'
require 'uri'

uri = URI("http://localhost:5075/api/v1/external-services/register")
http = Net::HTTP.new(uri.host, uri.port)

request = Net::HTTP::Post.new(uri)
request["X-API-Key"] = "dn_votre_cle"
request["Content-Type"] = "application/json"
request.body = {
  name: "Mon Service",
  slug: "mon-service",
  baseUrl: "https://api.monservice.com"
}.to_json

response = http.request(request)
puts response.body</code></pre>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header"><h5 class="mb-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="vertical-align:-2px"><path d="M1 2.828c.885-.37 2.154-.769 4-.9V13.5c-1.842.115-3.114.51-4 .9V2.828zM5 .5c1.84-.13 3.366-.065 5 .065V12.9c-1.634-.13-3.16-.195-5-.065V.5zM15 2.828v10.472c-.815-.345-1.983-.668-3-.747V1.97c1.148.059 2.31.36 3 .858zM10 1.23c1.16-.13 2.322-.208 3-.166V12.9c-.678.042-1.84.036-3-.166V1.23z"/></svg> Obtenir un token OIDC</h5></div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Flux <strong>password</strong> (pour vos propres applications back-end) :</p>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>curl -X POST @Model.IdentityUrl/connect/token \
  -H "Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded" \
  -d "grant_type=password" \
  -d "username=user@example.com" \
  -d "password=MotDePasse123" \
  -d "scope=openid profile email roles offline_access"</code></pre>

                    <p class="mt-3">Flux <strong>client_credentials</strong> (pour les APIs) :</p>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>curl -X POST @Model.IdentityUrl/connect/token \
  -H "Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded" \
  -d "grant_type=client_credentials" \
  -d "client_id=votre_client_id" \
  -d "client_secret=votre_client_secret" \
  -d "scope=api"</code></pre>
                </div>
            </div>

            @* ──── Carte : Gérer vos clés API ──── *@
            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header"><h5 class="mb-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="vertical-align:-2px"><path d="M8 1a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4H6V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zm3 6V3a3 3 0 0 0-6 0v4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v5a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h6a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"/></svg> Gérer vos clés API</h5></div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Créez, listez, faites rotate et supprimez vos clés API depuis le tableau de bord ou via l'API.</p>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">cURL — Lister les clés</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>curl -X GET http://localhost:5075/api/v1/admin/tenants/{tenantId}/api-keys \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer {token}"</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">cURL — Créer une clé</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>curl -X POST http://localhost:5075/api/v1/admin/tenants/{tenantId}/api-keys \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer {token}" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name": "Ma clé de prod", "scopes": ["api"]}'</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">cURL — Faire rotate (régénérer) une clé</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>curl -X POST http://localhost:5075/api/v1/admin/tenants/{tenantId}/api-keys/{keyId}/rotate \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer {token}"</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">cURL — Supprimer une clé</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>curl -X DELETE http://localhost:5075/api/v1/admin/tenants/{tenantId}/api-keys/{keyId} \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer {token}"</code></pre>
                </div>
            </div>

            @* ──── Carte : Modifier un service (PATCH) ──── *@
            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header"><h5 class="mb-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="vertical-align:-2px"><path d="M12.146.146a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0l3 3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708l-10 10a.5.5 0 0 1-.168.11l-5 2a.5.5 0 0 1-.65-.65l2-5a.5.5 0 0 1 .11-.168l10-10z"/></svg> Modifier un service (PATCH)</h5></div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Mettez à jour l'URL, la description ou l'endpoint santé d'un service enregistré.</p>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">cURL</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>curl -X PATCH http://localhost:5075/api/v1/external-services/{serviceId} \
  -H "X-API-Key: dn_ma_cle" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"baseUrl": "https://nouvelle-url.com", "description": "Mise à jour"}'</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">Python</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>import requests
response = requests.patch(
    "http://localhost:5075/api/v1/external-services/{id}",
    json={"baseUrl": "https://nouvelle-url.com"},
    headers={"X-API-Key": "dn_ma_cle"}
)
print(response.json())</code></pre>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        @* ──── Onglet 2 : Gateway ──── *@
        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="fr-gateway" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header"><h5 class="mb-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="vertical-align:-2px"><path d="M8 0a8 8 0 1 0 0 16A8 8 0 0 0 8 0zM2.04 4.81A6.503 6.503 0 0 1 7 1.18v.7c0 .6-.4 1.1-.9 1.4l-.5.3c-.5.3-.6.9-.3 1.3l.3.4c.2.3.3.7.1 1.1l-.4.7c-.2.3-.5.5-.9.5h-.3c-.6 0-1.1.5-1.1 1.1v.7c0 .6-.5 1.1-1.1 1.1-.2 0-.3 0-.5-.1l-.5-.3a6.44 6.44 0 0 1-1.32-3.97zm7.85 8.55A6.48 6.48 0 0 1 8 14.82v-.9c0-.7.4-1.3.9-1.7l.2-.1c.5-.3.9-.9.7-1.5l-.3-.8c-.1-.3 0-.6.1-.8l1-1.2c.3-.3.7-.5 1.1-.5h.7c.4 0 .8-.1 1.1-.3l.1-.1c.5.9.8 2.1.6 3.3a6.51 6.51 0 0 1-3.8 3.68z"/></svg> Gateway — Accès aux services externes</h5></div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Une fois votre service enregistré, appelez-le via le Gateway avec votre <strong>clé API</strong> ou un <strong>token JWT</strong> :</p>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">cURL</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code># Avec clé API
curl -X GET @Model.GatewayUrl/ext/mon-service/health \
  -H "X-API-Key: dn_ma_cle"

# Avec token JWT (récupéré via /connect/token)
curl -X GET @Model.GatewayUrl/ext/mon-service/api/ressources \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer eyJ..."</code></pre>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">Python</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-3 rounded"><code>import requests

GATEWAY = "@Model.GatewayUrl"
API_KEY = "dn_ma_cle"
