            @* ──── Card: Health Monitoring ──── *@
            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header"><h5 class="mb-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="vertical-align:-2px"><path d="M8 16s6-5.686 6-10A6 6 0 0 0 2 6c0 4.314 6 10 6 10zm0-7a3 3 0 1 1 0-6 3 3 0 0 1 0 6z"/></svg> Health Monitoring</h5></div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>The Gateway periodically checks the health of your external services (every 30 seconds).</p>
                    <p>If a service fails to respond 3 times in a row, its status changes to <strong>Suspended</strong>.</p>
                    <p>Check health status from the dashboard: <code>/Developer/Services</code> — ✅ green means OK, ❌ red means failures.</p>
