                    <p>Error codes returned by the Gateway and Identity API:</p>

                    <table class="table table-bordered">
                        <thead class="table-light">
                            <tr>
                                <th>Code</th>
                                <th>Cause</th>
                                <th>Solution</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="error-code">401</span></td>
                                <td>Missing or invalid API key</td>
