                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="error-code">403</span></td>
                                <td>JWT token expired or invalid</td>
                                <td>Get a new token via <code>/connect/token</code>. Verify requested scopes.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="error-code">404</span></td>
                                <td>Service slug not found</td>
                                <td>Verify the service is registered and active. <code>GET /api/v1/external-services</code> to list.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="error-code">429</span></td>
                                <td>Too many requests (rate limited)</td>
                                <td>Wait 60 seconds before retrying. Contact us to increase the limit.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="error-code">502</span></td>
                                <td>External service unreachable</td>
                                <td>Check that your service is running. Gateway times out after 30 seconds.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="error-code">504</span></td>
                                <td>External service timeout</td>
                                <td>The remote service took too long to respond. Optimize response time.</td>
                            </tr>
